## 6. App Pages & Roles

### Route Map

```
/                     → redirect to /store (if logged in) or /login
/login                → Google sign-in button
/store                → item grid + cart (all authenticated users)
/checkout             → cart review, student info, submit
/admin                → admin home (shopkeeper role only)
/admin/items          → add / edit / remove items, toggle stock
/admin/stock          → receive stock deliveries, view stock log
/admin/reports        → transaction log, daily summary view
```

### Roles

| Role | Access | How assigned |
|---|---|---|
| Student | `/store`, `/checkout` | Any `@school.edu` Google login |
| Shopkeeper (admin) | All routes | Gmail address in `ADMIN_EMAILS` env variable |

Middleware (`middleware.ts`) redirects non-admins away from `/admin/*`. If the domain check fails on sign-in, the user is rejected entirely.

