## 10. Future Features

| Feature | Approach |
|---|---|
| Email notifications on purchase | Add `nodemailer` or Resend to checkout API route; send to student + admin |
| Multiple dorm tabs | Add `dorm` column to `items`; tab selector on `/store` |
| Inventory alerts | Cron job checks `stock_count <= threshold`; emails admin |
| Barcode scanning | Add `barcode` column to items; integrate `html5-qrcode` on store page |
| Photo recognition | Camera input on add-item form; Vision API to suggest item details |
| Coop connection | Separate Sheets workbook or additional tabs, same API pattern |
| Offline support | Service worker + local queue; sync to Sheets when back online |

